<section class="chapter story-stage" id="decision-3"><p class="chapter-index">03 / DECISION</p><div><h2>Make the research useful for prospecting</h2><p class="decision-summary">Translate the findings into profiles that sales and marketing can use.</p><details class="decision-context"><summary>Read the decision context <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>The project defined ideal, acceptable and incompatible company profiles, alongside buyer personas. The framework gave the consultancy a way to discuss which prospects deserved effort and how communication could respond to their context.</p></details><blockquote>The value of a profile is in the choices it helps a team make.</blockquote></div></section>
